WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.571 size:84% position:42%
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt;&gt; THANK YOU, NEW YORK.
&gt;&gt; NEW YORK.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:11.444
&gt;&gt; NEW YORK.
&gt;&gt; THINGS GOT PRETTY TOUGH HERE

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.680
THIS SUMMER.
&gt;&gt; BUT THROUGH IT ALL, WE STAYED

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:18.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
STRONG.
&gt;&gt; WE STAYED TOGETHER.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:22.922
&gt;&gt; AND WE NEVER LOST WHO WE ARE.
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE WE ARE NEW YORK.

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:25.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NEW YORK.
&gt;&gt; NEW YORK.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:27.427
&gt;&gt; AND NO MATTER HOW HARD THINGS
GET --

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:31.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WE ALWAYS GET THROUGH IT.
&gt;&gt; AND WE DO IT OUR WAY.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; EACH AND EVERY ONE OF US
PLAYED A PART.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:38.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; FROM THE NURSES WHO KEPT US
SAFE --

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:41.708
&gt;&gt; TO THE ESSENTIAL WORKERS WHO
KEPT FOOD ON OUR TABLE --

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:46.212
&gt;&gt; TO ALL THE NEIGHBORS WHO JUST
PITCHED IN.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YES, SOME THINGS ARE
DIFFERENT.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:53.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BUT MOST THINGS ARE EXACTLY
THE SAME.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BEAUTIFUL.
&gt;&gt; UNBREAKABLE.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:58.958
&gt;&gt; ONE OF A KIND.
&gt;&gt; IF YOU'RE NOT FROM HERE, COME

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
