&gt;&gt; THE MUSEUMS.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:05.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THE LANDMARKS.
&gt;&gt; AND THIS LADY.

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:12.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SORT OF A DANCING OLDER
WOMAN?

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:15.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NOT HOMELESS, JUST PERKY.
SHE HAS AN APARTMENT.

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.976
