SHE'S OUT.

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:24.851
&gt;&gt; SHE LIVED IN A STUDIO SINCE
SHE WAS 16, WHICH WAS 30 OR 100

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:31.424
