&gt;&gt; SHE'S NOT NOT A PROFESSOR AT

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:33.626
COLUMBIA.
&gt;&gt; UNTIL BROADWAY REOPENS SHE'S

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.128
PERFORMING HER ONE-WOMAN VERSION
OF "THE LION KING" IN THE PARK

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:40.900
EVERY DAY.
&gt;&gt; NEW YORK IS NOT A GHOST TOWN.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT'S HIS TOWN.
IT'S HER TOWN.

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:48.141
&gt;&gt; AND IT'S DEFINITELY HER TOWN.
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU!

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:50.143
&gt;&gt; SO TODAY WE WANT TO SAY THANK
YOU.

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:52.645
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE NEW YORK WILL ALWAYS

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:56.382
BE NEW YORK.
&gt;&gt; AND WE'RE SO PROUD TO SAY --

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:59.152
&gt;&gt; THE PEOPLE JUST CRAZY ENOUGH
TO CALL THIS PLACE HOME WILL

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:04.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
ALWAYS BE HERE.
&gt;&gt; I LOVE NEW YORK!

